WEBVTT

00:00:00.402 --> 00:00:05.266
Pick Cascade for games where symbols drop in, and winners pop to make room for new ones.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.065
A cascade round is a chain of tumbles.

00:00:08.065 --> 00:00:09.545
Each tumble is one win.

00:00:09.898 --> 00:00:11.412
Click a tumble to set it up.

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:14.494
Each tumble has its own symbol, cells and win.

00:00:14.494 --> 00:00:17.932
Pick its cells on the board as the fall before it left it.

00:00:18.288 --> 00:00:21.062
Add tumble puts one more win at the end of the chain.

00:00:21.415 --> 00:00:23.506
Remove tumble takes out the picked one.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:26.600
The drop order sets which reel drops in first.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.745
The landing sets how a symbol lands.

00:00:29.098 --> 00:00:31.680
Pop draws a burst over each winner as it leaves.

00:00:32.035 --> 00:00:32.907
Play the round.

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:36.280
The board drops in, and the tumbles win one after another.
